  </div>

  <div class="agreement-text" style="margin-top: 20px;">
    Do you have any drug or food sensitivities or allergies? If yes, please explain (condition, treatment).
  </div>

  <div class="agreement-text" style="margin-top: 30px;">
    I verify all information in this health disclosure is complete, accurate and true. I acknowledge that, ultimately, I am responsible for my own physical and mental well-being.
  </div>

  <div class="agreement-text">
    In the event of a medical emergency in which I become incoherent or incapable to make decisions, I authorize UIW representatives to take actions deemed necessary or to arrange for professional medical care on my behalf, at my own expense. In addition, I authorize UIW representatives to notify my emergency contact(s) found on this agreement.
  </div>

  <div class="agreement-text" style="margin-top: 20px;">
    I understand providing accurate information is an important part of fulfilling my responsibilities.
  </div>

  <div class="signature-block">
    <div>
      <span class="form-label">Signature:</span>
      <div class="signature-line"></div>
    </div>
    <div>
      <span class="form-label">Date:</span>
      <div class="signature-line"></div>
    </div>
